  "title": "1st Anniversary Gift for Husband, Paper Anniversary, Cancer Libra Couple Printable Art, Cancer Gifts, Libra Gifts",
  "description": "A personalized 1st anniversary gift for your husband or your wife, made from your two zodiac signs, Cancer and Libra. Your names and your special date are added to your own shared symbol, for married couples and for couples celebrating one year together. A thoughtful choice when you are looking for Cancer gifts or Libra gifts.\n\nEvery AstroLoveArt design merges two zodiac signs into one shared symbol. This listing is for the Cancer and Libra symbol shown in the photos.\n\nEvery fusion symbol begins as an original AstroLoveArt design. We use AI tools to help create the artwork, and every design is reviewed and finished by us.\n\nHOW TO ORDER\n1. Choose your style and your format.\n2. Fill in the personalization boxes: the name under Cancer, the name under Libra and your special date (your wedding day or the day you met). Example: Cancer: Emma, Libra: James, 14 June 2025.\n3. Heading: &quot;Paper Anniversary&quot; for married couples or &quot;Our First Year&quot; for couples who are dating. The card always says &quot;Happy First Anniversary&quot;.\n4. Optional short line: up to 20 characters of your own to replace &quot;Year One&quot;. Leave it empty to keep &quot;Year One&quot;.\n\nFREE PREVIEW BEFORE YOU ORDER\nWould you like to see your design first? Message us your names, your date and your chosen style, and we will send you a free preview.\n\nAFTER YOU ORDER\nWe send your final preview in Etsy Messages within 24 hours. As soon as you approve it, we prepare your file or your print.\n\nDELIVERY\n- Digital card and digital file: sent in Etsy Messages as soon as you approve your preview.\n- Shipped print: made and shipped within 4 to 7 days after your approval, with free shipping worldwide. Estimated delivery: US 3 to 8 days, UK and Australia 5 to 10 days, EU 5 to 12 days, other countries 7 to 21 days.\n\nSTYLES\nStarlit, Timeless, First Page, Layers, Botanical.\n\nFORMATS\n- Digital card 5x7: a single-sided flat card sent as a digital file, to print at home or at a print shop. Nothing is shipped.\n- Digital file 8x10: an 8x10 inch, 300 dpi JPG for your own printing. Nothing is shipped.\n- Shipped print 8x10: printed on premium matte art paper with long-lasting inks and shipped to you by our production partner.\n\nPLEASE NOTE\nThe gold, relief and paper layer looks are printed effects in the design. When printed, the design is flat, with no foil, raised layers or cut paper pieces. Colors may look slightly different on screen and on paper.\n\nWHY PAPER\nPaper is the traditional gift for the first wedding anniversary. Print your card at home or at a print shop and give a paper gift made only for the two of you.\n\nRETURNS\nEvery item is personalized, so we can&#39;t accept returns or exchanges. Digital files can&#39;t be refunded once sent. If your print arrives damaged, send us a photo within 7 days and we&#39;ll replace it at no cost.",
